msgstr "Memperlambat"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7736
msgid "On-screen keyboard"
msgstr "Keyboard layar"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7744
msgid "Reset to default"
msgstr "Atur ulang ke bawaan"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7747
msgid "Save as my mapping"
msgstr "Simpan sebagai pemetaan saya"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7750
msgid "Use my mapping"
msgstr "Pakai pemetaan saya"

#. A button hint along the bottom of the screen, beside a button's picture: keep it short (one or two words).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7762
msgid "Choose a key"
msgstr "Pilih tombol"

#. A button hint along the bottom of the screen, beside a button's picture: keep it short (one or two words).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7762 title/pc5_ui.c:9239
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Atur ulang"

#. A menu row's name (about 30 characters fit).
#. In a question window: the title, its text, or a button's label (keep buttons short).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:7763 title/pc5_ui.c:8807 title/pc5_ui.c:8878
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Simpan"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7763
msgid "Use"
msgstr "Pakai"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7784
#, c-format
msgid "What %s sends"
msgstr "Yang dikirim %s"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7802
msgid "The usual way for older games like this one, with their 2D and 3D."
msgstr "Cara biasa untuk game lama seperti ini, dengan 2D dan 3D-nya."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7803
msgid ""
"Draws as Windows programs do, with OpenGL ready in case the game asks for "
"it. Leave it here unless the game won't start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7804
msgid ""
"The fastest, and what most games want. Leave it here unless the game won't "
"start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Paling cepat, dan yang diinginkan sebagian besar game. Biarkan saja, "
"kecuali game tidak mau jalan atau gambarnya salah."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7806
msgid ""
"Draws as Windows programs do, without OpenGL. For a game that starts or "
"draws worse with Auto."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7808
msgid ""
"Another way to draw the game, slower than Auto. Try it if the game won't "
"start or its picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Cara lain untuk menggambar game, lebih lambat dari Otomatis. Coba jika "
"game tidak mau jalan atau gambarnya salah."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7810
msgid ""
"Draws everything in 2D, the way ordinary Windows programs are drawn. For a "
"2D game that flickers or shows only part of its screen; a game with 3D "
"scenes won't start with it."
msgstr ""
"Menggambar semuanya dalam 2D, seperti program Windows biasa digambar. "
"Untuk game 2D yang berkedip atau hanya menampilkan sebagian layarnya; game "
"dengan adegan 3D tidak akan jalan dengan ini."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7812
msgid ""
"Another way to draw the game. Try it if the picture is wrong with Auto; "
"faster than Compatibility. Some mods need it."
msgstr ""
"Cara lain untuk menggambar game. Coba jika gambarnya salah dengan "
"Otomatis; lebih cepat dari Kompatibel. Beberapa mod memerlukannya."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7813
msgid ""
"The slowest, but it starts the most games. Try it if the game won't start "
"with the others."
msgstr ""
"Paling lambat, tapi paling banyak game bisa jalan. Coba jika game tidak "
"mau jalan dengan yang lain."

