#: title/pc5_web_page.html:159
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"PC5 picks the game's cover, background and details by this number (%s%s). "
"If they are another game's, type the number from the game's Steam store "
"link (store.steampowered.com/app/<number>). Empty: PC5 reads the folder "
"again."
msgstr ""
"PC5 memilih sampul, latar belakang, dan detail game berdasarkan nomor ini "
"(%s%s). Jika ternyata milik game lain, ketik nomor dari tautan toko Steam "
"game itu (store.steampowered.com/app/<nomor>). Kosong: PC5 membaca folder "
"lagi."

