"The console's File manager changes them too, a line at a time."
msgstr ""
"Hanya file teks (.ini, .cfg, .txt, .json, .reg, dan sejenisnya), hingga 8 "
"MB. Pengelola file di konsol juga bisa mengubahnya, per baris."

